# The buyer app's settings, read by the Expo CLI from apps/mobile/.env when it
# bundles: copy this file to .env (never versioned) and set your values.
# EXPO_PUBLIC_* values are inlined in the bundle: never put a secret here.

# The API, through nginx on the development PC, as the phone reaches it on the
# LAN: http://<the PC's IPv4 address on the Wi-Fi>:8080 (`ipconfig` on Windows).
# The same value goes in PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL in the root .env, and the address
# in its ALLOWED_HOSTS; see CONTRIBUTING.md, "Buyer app".
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://192.168.1.20:8080
